      <note>About&#x3a; Reads the matched IMPS batch and builds one journal line per txn - debit the&#xd;&#xa;outward clearing suspense GL, credit the RBI RTGS settlement GL. Lines whose net variance&#xd;&#xa;is exactly 0.00 are knocked off; any other line is logged as an error and set aside.&#xd;&#xa;&#xd;&#xa;Params&#x3a; Matched batch file, suspense GL, settlement GL, cycle ID.&#xd;&#xa;&#xd;&#xa;Output&#x3a; Balanced_Ledger_IMPS_&lt;timestamp&gt;.xlsx and Variance_Exceptions_IMPS_&lt;timestamp&gt;.xlsx, attached to the&#xd;&#xa;workflow result for download. Complete when the batch nets to 0.00, Failure when the&#xd;&#xa;ledger is out of balance, Diverted when there is no data.&#xd;&#xa;&#xd;&#xa;Errors&#x3a; Malformed input rows go down the error hop to the error log and end with Failure.</note>
      <xloc>608</xloc>
      <yloc>512</yloc>
      <width>740</width>
      <heigth>236</heigth>
